<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide the full prompt templates used in our experiments below.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>TriviaQA and Natural Questions</h3>

<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Without Cue</h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para"><pre id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">
You will be given a question.
Give your final answer in
&lt;answer&gt;&lt;/answer&gt; tags.
</pre>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">With Cue</h4>

