<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Reasoning-SFT Baseline Details</h2>

<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To make our Reasoning-SFT training comparable to RL training, we randomly sample 40,000 (1,240 steps <math id="A8.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> 32 batch size) traces with correct recall from the base model’s generations. We train with LoRA (rank=32), a learning rate of <math id="A8.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\times 10^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\times 10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>, and a batch size of 32 for 8 epochs. We select the checkpoint at step 6,000 for evaluation based on validation loss.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A9" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix I </span>SFT Baseline Details</h2>

<div id="A9.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For our supervised finetuning of GPT-OSS-20B on TriviaQA, we fix the same TriviaQA dataset as used for reinforcement learning. Likewise, we use the same LoRA hyperparameters (rank 32).
We test three configurations of dataset format, batch size, and learning rate, detailed below.</p>
<div id="A9.p1.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64,PHxjaGFubmVsfD5hbmFseXNpczx8bWVzc2FnZXw+QW5zd2VyOgp7YW5zd2VyfS48fGVuZHw+PHxzdGFydHw+YXNzaXN0YW50PHxjaGFubmVsfD5maW5hbDx8bWVzc2FnZXw+PGFuc3dlcj4Ke2Fuc3dlcn08L2Fuc3dlcj4u" download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx18" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx18.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;|</span><span id="lstnumberx18.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">channel</span><span id="lstnumberx18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">|&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx18.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">analysis</span><span id="lstnumberx18.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;|</span><span id="lstnumberx18.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">message</span><span id="lstnumberx18.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">|&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx18.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Answer</span><span id="lstnumberx18.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">:</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx19" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{</span><span id="lstnumberx19.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">answer</span><span id="lstnumberx19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">}.&lt;|</span><span id="lstnumberx19.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">end</span><span id="lstnumberx19.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">|&gt;&lt;|</span><span id="lstnumberx19.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">start</span><span id="lstnumberx19.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">|&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx19.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">assistant</span><span id="lstnumberx19.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;|</span><span id="lstnumberx19.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">channel</span><span id="lstnumberx19.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">|&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx19.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">final</span><span id="lstnumberx19.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;|</span><span id="lstnumberx19.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">message</span><span id="lstnumberx19.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">|&gt;&lt;</span><span id="lstnumberx19.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">answer</span><span id="lstnumberx19.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&gt;</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx20" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{</span><span id="lstnumberx20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">answer</span><span id="lstnumberx20.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">}&lt;/</span><span id="lstnumberx20.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">answer</span><span id="lstnumberx20.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&gt;.</span>
</div>
</div>
<p id="A9.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">learning rate: 1e-4, batch size: 128, epoch: 1</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A9.p1.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">EM:</span> 21.6%, <span id="A9.p1.3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Recall:</span> 26.2%

<br class="ltx_break"></p>
<div id="A9.p1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64,PHxjaGFubmVsfD5hbmFseXNpczx8bWVzc2FnZXw+TmVlZCBhbnN3ZXI6IHthbnN3ZXJ9Ljx8ZW5kfD48fHN0YXJ0fD5hc3Npc3RhbnQ8fGNoYW5uZWx8PmZpbmFsPHxtZXNzYWdlfD5UaGUgYW5zd2VyIGlzIDxhbnN3ZXI+e2Fuc3dlcn08L2Fuc3dlcj4u" download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx21" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;|</span><span id="lstnumberx21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">channel</span><span id="lstnumberx21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">|&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx21.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">analysis</span><span id="lstnumberx21.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;|</span><span id="lstnumberx21.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">message</span><span id="lstnumberx21.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">|&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx21.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Need</span><span id="lstnumberx21.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">answer</span><span id="lstnumberx21.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">:</span><span id="lstnumberx21.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{</span><span id="lstnumberx21.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">answer</span><span id="lstnumberx21.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">}.&lt;|</span><span id="lstnumberx21.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">end</span><span id="lstnumberx21.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">|&gt;&lt;|</span><span id="lstnumberx21.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">start</span><span id="lstnumberx21.19" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">|&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx21.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">assistant</span><span id="lstnumberx21.21" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;|</span><span id="lstnumberx21.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">channel</span><span id="lstnumberx21.23" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">|&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx21.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">final</span><span id="lstnumberx21.25" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;|</span><span id="lstnumberx21.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">message</span><span id="lstnumberx21.27" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">|&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx21.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">The</span><span id="lstnumberx21.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">answer</span><span id="lstnumberx21.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">is</span><span id="lstnumberx21.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.34" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;</span><span id="lstnumberx21.35" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">answer</span><span id="lstnumberx21.36" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&gt;{</span><span id="lstnumberx21.37" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">answer</span><span id="lstnumberx21.38" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">}&lt;/</span><span id="lstnumberx21.39" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">answer</span><span id="lstnumberx21.40" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&gt;.</span>
</div>
